@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 使用说明
# 1. 先运行 00-seed-data.http 创建作品库数据
# 2. collection 只管理“想看 / 搁置”
# 3. 如果作品已经有正式 record，后端会拒绝加入收藏
# 4. 必须先运行“1. 加入想看”，它会自动保存 collection_id
# 5. 然后才能运行 PUT / DELETE 这类需要 collection_id 的请求

### 1. 加入想看
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectId": {{subject_hidden_id}},
  "collectionType": "WANT",
  "note": "后续想补"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("collection_id", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 2. 移动到搁置
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/{{collection_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collectionType": "PAUSED",
  "note": "暂时搁置"
}

### 3. 查询想看清单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collections?type=WANT&page=0&size=12

### 4. 查询搁置清单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collections?type=PAUSED&page=0&size=12

### 5. 删除收藏
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/{{collection_id}}

### 6. 快捷加入想看
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/want/{{subject_hidden_id}}

> {%
    client.global.set("collection_id", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 7. 快捷加入搁置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/paused/{{subject_hidden_id}}

> {%
    client.global.set("collection_id", response.body.data.id);
%}